  "observations": "The winter 2021 station further south shows the first complete side bay, both floors and the next bay. The upper opening shows two pale lights and a central stile. On the lower floor the canopy and railing partly screen a higher light and three pale uprights across the lower register. Two February streetstations see that opening; pane depth and opening hardware behind the additions are uncertain. No projecting awning, guardrail or adjacent deeper bay is assigned to the window geometry.",
